---
slug: mcp
method: get
---
{%- comment -%}
  GET /mcp answers 405 Method Not Allowed: the endpoint is POST-only. The server
  opens no standalone server-to-client SSE stream; the 2025-06-18 Streamable HTTP
  transport requires such a server to answer GET with 405, and 2026-07-28 recommends
  405 for clients of earlier revisions.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign allow = { "Allow": "POST" }
  assign allow_json = allow | json
  response_headers allow_json
  response_status 405
-%}
